  "steps": [
    "Roast garlic, peanuts, salt and chillies and then grind this with coriander and lemon juice using a mortar and pestle until its of the consistency shown in the video. You can also add 1 tsp oil if needed.",
    "Chop into rectangles and coat it with this thecha mixture and let it sit for 20-25 mins in the fridge.",
    "Grill your paneer on a pan (in 1 tsp oil) until all sides are golden brown.",
    "Mix it well to make your base.",
    "Take a wheat roti, add the base sauce layer, thecha paneer, thinly sliced onions and boiled beetroot slices.",
    "Roll it up and enjoy."
